WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:03.068
OSCAR DE LA HOYA:
<i> The world fell in love
 with my story.</i>

00:00:03.168 --> 00:00:04.637
♪ (INTENSE MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:06.172 --> 00:00:07.607
But it was a lie.

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:13.113
ANNOUNCER:<i> The pride of
 East LA, the Golden Boy.</i>

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:16.082
SPEAKER:
<i> Oscar De La Hoya was</i>

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:20.153
<i> the most popular fighter
 since Muhammad Ali.</i>

00:00:23.222 --> 00:00:27.293
I've never told anybody
what really happened.

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:33.166
<i> At six years old,
 out come the gloves.</i>

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:34.768
-(BELL DINGS)
<i> -Started fighting kids.</i>

00:00:36.769 --> 00:00:38.104
<i> Punched in the face.</i>

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:40.573
<i> My father told me,
 "Be tough!</i>

00:00:40.673 --> 00:00:43.109
<i> You're gonna take us out
 of this lifestyle."</i>

00:00:43.943 --> 00:00:44.977
That's a lot of pressure.

00:00:45.711 --> 00:00:47.680
SPEAKER 2:<i> He said he was
gonna be champion of the world.</i>

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:48.548
(CHILDREN LAUGHING)

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:50.049
OSCAR:<i> What are you
 laughing at?</i>

00:00:50.149 --> 00:00:51.584
<i> This is my dream.</i>

00:00:52.752 --> 00:00:54.287
<i> I'm gonna show you.</i>

00:00:56.089 --> 00:01:00.126
Before my mother passed away,
she told me she wanted
the gold medal.

00:01:01.093 --> 00:01:03.530
OSCAR:<i> I was on a mission
 to make history.</i>

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:08.968
<i> I'm 24, making 20 million
 dollars a fight.</i>

00:01:09.068 --> 00:01:10.470
There was nobody bigger.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.839
<i> I was hanging out with
 beautiful women.</i>

00:01:13.672 --> 00:01:14.907
I felt like a star.

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:17.010
ANNOUNCER 2:<i> Everything
 De La Hoya touches</i>

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:18.411
<i> has turned to gold.</i>

00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:20.246
OSCAR:<i> The golden left hook.</i>

00:01:20.647 --> 00:01:21.780
<i> The golden story.</i>

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:24.484
<i> But truth always comes out.</i>

00:01:25.718 --> 00:01:28.555
<i> And I knew it would come back
 to haunt me.</i>

00:01:30.189 --> 00:01:31.357
<i> Money changes everything.</i>

00:01:31.991 --> 00:01:33.593
SPEAKER 3:<i> Nothing he said
 to me was the truth.</i>

00:01:33.693 --> 00:01:36.296
OSCAR:<i> My dream
 became a nightmare.</i>

00:01:39.465 --> 00:01:43.303
All this anger.
I have to free myself.

00:01:44.871 --> 00:01:47.707
<i> I won 11 world titles
in six different weight classes.</i>

00:01:49.007 --> 00:01:50.243
<i> I want to be that hero.</i>

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:52.611
<i> I can see myself fighting,</i>

00:01:52.711 --> 00:01:54.881
and I don't even know
why I'm fighting.

00:01:57.984 --> 00:01:59.685
<i> Who in the fuck am I?</i>

00:02:00.119 --> 00:02:02.722
♪ (INTENSE STRINGS PLAY) ♪

